  cookingInstructions:
  - 'Chop the white onion into slice '
  - 'Chop the garlic into slice '
  - 'Chop the tomato into slice '
  - Turn on the stove to high heat
  - Put the Pan in the Stove
  - Add 1 tbsp of cooking oil
  - Add butter
  - Add the chicken legs
  - Mix it using Spatula
  - Put the sear chicken in the bowl
  - Add the onions in the pan
  - Add the garlic in the pan
  - Add the bay leaf in the pan
  - Add the chop tomato in the pan
  - Put the pan lid to simmer
  - Add 1/4 cup of soy
  - Add 1/8 tsp of sugar
  - Mix well using spatula
  - Return the chicken back to the pan
  - Put the pan lid to simmer
  - Add 1/2 tsp of achuete oil
  - Add 1/8 tsp of salt
  - Mix using the spatula
